      "en": "the blind receive their sight, the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, the deaf hear,the dead are raised up, and the poor have good news preached to them.",
      "ko": "소경이 보며 앉은뱅이가 걸으며 문둥이가 깨끗함을 받으며 귀머거리가 들으며 죽은 자가 살아나며 가난한 자에게 복음이 전파된다 하라",
      "source_text_hash": "ec9fdafabebf621212357eee434e10c56bb54ea6264211310f63c8a9ed29a1e9",
      "translation_text_hash": "261da822e29d96b694dba14f17572896993acb418923fbabc0bcd47448745803",
