      "en": "From the days of John the Baptizer until now, the Kingdom of Heaven suffers violence, and the violent take it by force.",
      "ko": "세례 요한의 때부터 지금까지 천국은 침노를 당하나니 침노하는 자는 빼앗느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "bad83ee14429f26c0c270c06d85da14d3ed8596128e875a52bbd51f31e5e9cd5",
      "translation_text_hash": "4c8030d1f0007011c55766f0168493a220011124c7ace76b80cefe189d28bd4d",
